    "detailed_description": "<strong>Castle of the Underdogs</strong> is a comedy JRPG game inspired by Suikoden-like games, with strategic turn-based combat, mass recruiting and a castle HQ.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/847780/extras/859e81c065d5076259898ae08bb58fbc.poster.avif?t=1681497921\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/847780/extras/859e81c065d5076259898ae08bb58fbc.webm?t=1681497921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Join <strong>Hikaru</strong>, a mischevous and carefree girl that learns magic, in an absurd adventure where she must recruit dozens of friends in order to restore the peace in the Bestann Federation despite spreading <strong>chaos</strong> to most places she steps on.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/847780/extras/587bbc40bde273d4605e5e55a044c612.poster.avif?t=1681497921\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/847780/extras/587bbc40bde273d4605e5e55a044c612.webm?t=1681497921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/847780/extras/587bbc40bde273d4605e5e55a044c612.mp4?t=1681497921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong><u>A hilarious JRPG</u></strong><br>\tA story driven comedy with unpredictable situations and outcomes.<br></li><li><strong><u>Lots of recruitable characters and Castle headquarters</u></strong><br>\tRecruit characters during your adventure, each with his own ridiculous backstory, and visit them at your Castle HQ. From guys having problems distinguishing reality from fiction to plunger-throwing failed ninjas.<br></li><li><strong><u>Classic JRPG gameplay</u></strong><br>\tLearn spells and abilities, steal equipment, explore the country, assault and loot the villagers' houses, find treasures and fight against the bad guys.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/847780/extras/16f2b305262aac61e4f1b5e77397cf85.avif?t=1681497921\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/847780/extras/74cc88156dbb95936664ae38b44fbd4d.poster.avif?t=1681497921\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/847780/extras/74cc88156dbb95936664ae38b44fbd4d.webm?t=1681497921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/847780/extras/74cc88156dbb95936664ae38b44fbd4d.mp4?t=1681497921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong><u>Strategic battle</u></strong><br>\tTurn-based JRPG battle system that draws its features from both Final Fantasy X and Suikoden series.<br></li><li> <strong><u>Quick tagging</u></strong><br>\tControl 6 players in battle, 3 at the same time, and tag between them strategically. <br></li><li> <strong><u>Unite Attacks</u></strong><br>\tMake several characters collaborate to unleash special attacks combining their skills.<br></li><li> <strong><u>Knowledge system</u></strong><br>\t A complex knowledge system that allows you to discover the enemies strengths and weaknesses, allowing you to plan your battle actions accordingly, as well as collecting the bestiary data.<br></li><li> <strong><u>Create your own runes.</u></strong><br>\tImbue the knowledge learnt during your adventure and combine it to create more powerful runes.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/847780/extras/4dd2778cd74c21d60a09b5f01945fdf3.avif?t=1681497921\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/847780/extras/49bf6bc4dad387378d2f0c7cb8c86f6d.poster.avif?t=1681497921\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/847780/extras/49bf6bc4dad387378d2f0c7cb8c86f6d.webm?t=1681497921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/847780/extras/49bf6bc4dad387378d2f0c7cb8c86f6d.mp4?t=1681497921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong><u>Adjust difficult any time</u></strong><br>\t5 difficulty levels to choose from, you can either enjoy the adventure without any battle hassle or be challenged by mighty foes.<br></li><li> <strong><u>Flexible save system</u></strong><br>\t99 saveslots for each playthrough, and all the playthroughs you want.<br></li><li> <strong><u>Minigames</u></strong><br>\tSeveral minigames available that will be expanded in both content and number in the following episodes.</li></ul>",
